msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Dereferencing a __weak pointer is not allowed due to possible null value caused by race condition, assign it to strong variable first"
msgstr "由于竞态条件可能导致空值，不允许解引用 __weak 指针；请先将其赋值给 strong 变量"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:13389
msgctxt "diagnostic"
