msgid "Returning %0 from a function with result type %1 converts between void pointer and function pointer"
msgstr "从函数中返回 %0（结果类型为 %1）在 void 指针和函数指针之间进行转换"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:9380
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning %0 from a function with result type %1 discards overflow behavior"
msgstr "将 %0 从结果类型为 %1 的函数返回时会丢弃溢出行为"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:9366
#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:9395
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning %0 from a function with result type %1 discards qualifiers"
msgstr "从函数中返回 %0（结果类型为 %1）时丢弃了限定符"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:9408
#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:9422
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning %0 from a function with result type %1 discards qualifiers in nested pointer types"
msgstr "将 %0 从结果类型为 %1 的函数返回时会丢弃嵌套指针类型中的限定符"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4125
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument from a function with a different streaming-mode is undefined behaviour because the streaming vector length (%1 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%2 bit) differ"
msgstr "从具有不同流式模式的函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%1 位）与非流式向量长度（%2 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4112
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument from a function with a different streaming-mode is undefined behaviour when the streaming and non-streaming vector lengths are different at runtime"
msgstr "当流式与非流式向量长度在运行时不同时，返回依赖于 VL 的实参（来自具有不同流式模式的函数）属于未定义行为"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4116
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument from a locally streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming and non-streaming vector lengths are different at runtime"
msgstr "从局部流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参在运行时流式和非流式向量长度不同时属于未定义行为"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument from a non-streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方处于流式模式时，从非流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument from a non-streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is not in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方未处于流式模式时，从非流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument from a streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方处于流式模式时，从流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument from a streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is not in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方未处于流式模式时，从流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4125
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument to a function with a different streaming-mode is undefined behaviour because the streaming vector length (%1 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%2 bit) differ"
msgstr "向具有不同流式模式的函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%1 位）与非流式向量长度（%2 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4112
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument to a function with a different streaming-mode is undefined behaviour when the streaming and non-streaming vector lengths are different at runtime"
msgstr "当流式与非流式向量长度在运行时不同时，返回依赖于 VL 的实参（传入具有不同流式模式的函数）属于未定义行为"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4116
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument to a locally streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming and non-streaming vector lengths are different at runtime"
msgstr "向局部流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参在运行时流式和非流式向量长度不同时属于未定义行为"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument to a non-streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方处于流式模式时，向非流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument to a non-streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is not in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方未处于流式模式时，向非流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument to a streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方处于流式模式时，向流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:4120
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning a VL-dependent argument to a streaming function is undefined behaviour when the streaming-compatible caller is not in streaming mode, because the streaming vector length (%2 bit) and non-streaming vector length (%3 bit) differ"
msgstr "当流式兼容调用方未处于流式模式时，向流式函数返回依赖于 VL 的实参属于未定义行为，因为流式向量长度（%2 位）与非流式向量长度（%3 位）不同"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:10930
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning address of label, which is local"
msgstr "返回局部标签的地址"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:10922
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning address of local temporary object"
msgstr "正在返回局部临时对象的地址"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:10933
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning block that lives on the local stack"
msgstr "返回位于局部栈上的块"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:9501
msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Returning from function with different return type changes address space of nested pointer"
msgstr "从函数返回不同返回类型 改变了嵌套指针的地址空间"

#: clang/include/clang/Basic/DiagnosticSemaKinds.td:9488
msgctxt "diagnostic"
